    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f990bbdeb9bb1956839bd55e75ef2dec.avif?t=1755724832\" alt=\"says the word about, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.poster.avif?t=1755724832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.webm?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.mp4?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On My Way Out</strong> is a heartwarming adventure game about a spinning top trying to watch the sunset with his friends. The problem - the front gate won't budge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Culver</strong>, who will have to spin, jump and dive through the obstacles the neighborhood contains in order to find a way out. Explore daunting paths through the surrounding forest, lakes and desert, uncover the secrets this world holds, recover stolen relics, and meet your neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.poster.avif?t=1755724832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.webm?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.mp4?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/211f357a99cef6a718a4fe0536dca5fb.avif?t=1755724832\" alt=\"says the word feature, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Neighbors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know them that well, but that doesn\u2019t mean they weren\u2019t always out there. They might be able to help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysteries to Muster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world holds tight to it\u2019s secrets, but if you can crack the code, you can conquer the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Show Might Not Go On</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help recover museum relics or a neighbor\u2019s vision will be forgotten to time...again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oyster World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an oyster, this world is what you make of it. Many paths can lead to the same destination, so explore to your heart's content. Good luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.poster.avif?t=1755724832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.webm?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.mp4?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f990bbdeb9bb1956839bd55e75ef2dec.avif?t=1755724832\" alt=\"says the word about, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.poster.avif?t=1755724832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.webm?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.mp4?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On My Way Out</strong> is a heartwarming adventure game about a spinning top trying to watch the sunset with his friends. The problem - the front gate won't budge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Culver</strong>, who will have to spin, jump and dive through the obstacles the neighborhood contains in order to find a way out. Explore daunting paths through the surrounding forest, lakes and desert, uncover the secrets this world holds, recover stolen relics, and meet your neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.poster.avif?t=1755724832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.webm?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.mp4?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/211f357a99cef6a718a4fe0536dca5fb.avif?t=1755724832\" alt=\"says the word feature, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Neighbors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know them that well, but that doesn\u2019t mean they weren\u2019t always out there. They might be able to help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysteries to Muster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world holds tight to it\u2019s secrets, but if you can crack the code, you can conquer the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Show Might Not Go On</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help recover museum relics or a neighbor\u2019s vision will be forgotten to time...again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oyster World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an oyster, this world is what you make of it. Many paths can lead to the same destination, so explore to your heart's content. Good luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.poster.avif?t=1755724832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.webm?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.mp4?t=1755724832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
